      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\n\nEffect The ascended disciple cuts their tongue with a slashing weapon held in a hand (taking 1 slashing damage), then exhales a 15-foot cone of burning smoke. Each creature in the area must attempt a DC 22 Reflex save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes 2d8 fire damage.\n\nFailure The creature takes 4d8 fire damage and is Sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes 6d8 fire damage, is sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns, and is Enfeebled 1 by the smoke for 1 minute.",
